    "Did you ever use AI to support your math learning in the last year? If yes, how was your experience?": "No, but I’ve explored basic tools like step-by-step calculators for quick checks. My extraversion and conscientiousness make me prefer hands-on practice over relying on tech. Still, if a problem stumps me, I’d happily use AI to cross-verify—it’s less about crutching and more about collaboration.",
